---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import { Terminal, FileText, Play } from 'lucide-react'
---

<Layout title="Nanovision | Usage Guide">
  <main class="pt-24 pb-16 min-h-screen bg-background">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6">Usage Guide</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground mb-12">
        Learn how to generate coverage reports with Nanovision after installation.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-12">
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground flex items-center gap-2">
            <Terminal className="text-primary" />
            Basic Command
          </h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground">
            The most basic usage requires specifying the report file and the source directory.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-lg p-4 overflow-x-auto">
            <code class="text-sm font-mono text-foreground">nanovision -report coverage.out -sourcedirs .</code>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground flex items-center gap-2">
            <FileText className="text-primary" />
            Configuration File
          </h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground">
            For complex setups, it's recommended to use a <code>nanovision.yaml</code> file. <a
              href="/configurator"
              class="text-primary hover:underline">Generate file</a
            >.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-lg p-4 overflow-x-auto">
            <pre
              class="text-sm font-mono text-foreground"><code>reports:
  - "coverage.out"

source_dirs:
  - "."

output_dir: "coverage-report"

report_types:
  - "Html"
  - "TextSummary"</code></pre>
          </div>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground mt-2">
            Run nanovision without arguments to use the config file in the current directory.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground flex items-center gap-2">
            <Play className="text-primary" />
            CI/CD Integration
          </h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground">
            Nanovision is designed to run in your CI pipeline. It returns a non-zero exit code if coverage thresholds
            are not met.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 p-6 bg-secondary/20 rounded-xl border border-border">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2">Need a configuration file?</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4">Use our interactive tool to generate one for your project.</p>
        <a
          href="/configurator"
          class="inline-block bg-primary text-primary-foreground px-4 py-2 rounded-md font-medium hover:opacity-90"
        >
          Go to Configurator
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
